roved\nBUT: 25% CRL probability + high CMC risk\nRisk/reward needs careful assessment\n\nDecision: Enter only if:\n✓ Approval probability ≥70%\n✓ CMC assessment shows manageable risk\n✓ Company cash ≥$80M\nLOCATION:Entry Consideration - GUTS\nCATEGORIES:BIOTECH,PDUFA,HIGH-RISK,ENTRY-WINDOW\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\nEND:VEVENT\nBEGIN:VEVENT\nDTSTART:20260216T080000Z\nDTEND:20260216T090000Z\nDTSTAMP:20260201T192000Z\nUID:guts-t45-optimal-entry-20260216@odintrade.com\nSUMMARY:GUTS T-45 OPTIMAL ENTRY WINDOW (Guthrie Corp)\nDESCRIPTION:Guthrie Corp (GUTS) - GUT-089 for GI Disorder\n\nT-45 ENTRY WINDOW: NOW\nPDUFA in 12 days (Feb 28)\n\nENTRY DECISION:\nFinal assessment needed before entry:\n- Approval probability? (80%+ to justify entry with high CMC risk)\n- Company financials? (Cash ≥$80M)\n- Insider activity? (No recent discretionary sales)\n- Overall score: 6.0/10 (lower than ideal 6.5+)\n\nCAUTION:\n- High CMC risk = higher CRL probability\n- Position size: 1.5% MAX (vs standard 2%)\n- Exit discipline critical (T-5 hard stop)\n- Consider skipping if approval prob <75%\n\nIF ENTERING:\nTarget: +12-15% runup\nExit: T-5 (Feb 23) - no flexibility\nLOCATION:Trade Decision Point - GUTS\nCATEGORIES:BIOTECH,PDUFA,DECISION,HIGH-RISK\nSTATUS:CONFIRMED\nALARM:ACTIVE\nEND:VEVENT\nBEGIN:VEVENT\nDTSTART:20260228T160000Z\nDTEND:20260228T170000Z\nDTSTAMP:20260201T192000Z\nUID:guts-pdufa-decision-20260228@odintrade.com\nSUMMARY:GUTS PDUFA DECISION DAY (Guthrie Corp - GUT-089)\nDESCRIPTION:Guthrie Corp (GUTS) - GUT-089 for GI Disorder\n\nFDA PDUFA DECISION TODAY (February 28, 2026)\n\nYou should have exited Feb 23 (T-5) with +12-18% gain\n\nIF CRL ISSUED:\n- Likely CMC-related (given high CMC risk profile)\n- If so, watch for recovery opportunity T+7-T+14\n- But only buy dip if company has prior approvals (GUTS has none)\n- AVOID dip-buying first-time biotech CRL recoveries\n\nIF APPROVAL:\n- Congratulations on early exit with gains\n- Stock may spike today but expect sell-the-news\n- Do NO